# Ads Plugin Local Configuration

This file stores project-specific settings for the Google Ads plugin. It is gitignored by default to keep credentials and preferences local.

## How to Use

1. Copy this file to your project: `.claude/ads.local.md`
2. Fill in your `default_customer_id`
3. Adjust other settings as needed

## Settings Reference

### Account Settings

| Setting | Description |
|---------|-------------|
| `default_customer_id` | Your Google Ads customer ID (format: 123-456-7890) |
| `login_customer_id` | If using MCC, the manager account ID |

### Targeting Defaults

| Setting | Description |
|---------|-------------|
| `default_geo` | Target country/region for campaigns |
| `default_language` | Language code for ads and keywords |
| `default_location_code` | DataForSEO location code for keyword research |

### Safety Settings

| Setting | Description |
|---------|-------------|
| `budget_ceiling_daily` | Maximum daily budget allowed without explicit override |
| `dry_run_default` | When true, all mutations start in dry-run mode |

## Location Codes Reference

Common DataForSEO location codes:
- `2840` - United States
- `2826` - United Kingdom
- `2124` - Canada
- `2036` - Australia
- `2276` - Germany
- `2250` - France
